# LaTeX build artifacts. Keep only main.tex, paper.bib, and figure sources
# under version control; everything here is regenerated by pdflatex/bibtex
# (or by Overleaf, which compiles on its own and syncs back only what you
# edit) and just creates noisy diffs if committed.
*.aux
*.bbl
*.bcf
*.blg
*.fdb_latexmk
*.fls
*.log
*.out
*.run.xml
*.synctex.gz
*.toc
main.pdf
